# Milestone 1 Implementation Plan: Foundation, Styling & Supabase Auth Setup

## Milestone Overview
Milestone 1 establishes the rock-solid foundation for the entire Eside platform. It sets up the Next.js App Router monolith with strict TypeScript typing, Tailwind CSS custom theme tokens, shadcn/ui components, Supabase SSR client/server utilities, session refresh middleware, and initial deployment configs.

